, "My lotion, my laundry detergent, my skin itself."], [11.9, 13.44, "During the day, I was completely fine."], [13.68, 14.96, "Same house, same air,"], [15.08, 16.72, "but the second I got under those covers,"], [16.94, 19.5, "this deep itch would start, maybe 10 minutes in."], [19.62, 20.56, "And by four in the morning,"], [20.76, 22.08, "I'd wake up already scratching."], [22.48, 24.94, "One night, I slept on the couch just to test it."], [25.16, 27.52, "The itch didn't come, so I started reading."], [27.52, 30.14, "Dust mites burrow deep inside mattress foam."], [30.3, 32.38, "Deeper than washing or spraying can reach."], [32.62, 34.26, "I almost replaced the whole mattress."], [34.6, 36.1, "Then I found capture cards."], [36.34, 37.76, "They use a plant-derived lure"], [37.76, 40.38, "that attracts mites up from deep inside the foam."], [40.56, 42.8, "They crawl onto the card, the adhesive holds them,"], [42.96, 43.92, "and you throw the card away."], [44.18, 45.88, "Four cards, four corners of your bed,"], [46.04, 47.54, "replace them every 90 days."], [47.82, 50.04, "No spraying your skin, no spraying the mattress."], [50.24, 51.96, "Just a simple step to help manage"], [51.96, 53.0, "the mites where you sleep."], [53.18, 54.82, "See capture cards at the link below."], [55.02, 56.62, "There's a 90-day money-back guarantee"], [56.62, 58.6, "and you don't even need to return anything."]]}